 "titulo": "Every house on my street leaves a bowl out at 9 🐕 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "THE BOWL",
 "descripcion": "On Alder Street every house leaves a bowl on the sidewalk at nine. Kit laughed at the rule. At 2 AM, a huge black dog sat in the street, staring at his house.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you put the bowl out?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a street where every house leaves *a bowl* on the sidewalk at nine.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Kit is thirty-one. He just moved to Alder Street.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Cheap rent, big trees, and very polite neighbors.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "On the first night, his neighbor Ruth leaves a note in his mailbox.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every house leaves a bowl out at nine.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Never *feed it by hand*. Never let it see your door open.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Kit looks outside. Every porch has a metal bowl of raw meat.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "No dogs on the street. No barking. Just the bowls.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because Kit decided not to follow the rule.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He laughs, throws the note away, and goes to bed.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 2 AM, the streetlights flicker and the *barking* of every real dog stops.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Kit looks through the blinds.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the middle of the street sits a black dog, the size of a horse.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It's not eating. All the bowls on the street are full.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It's sitting in front of the *only house without a bowl*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Its eyes reflect the streetlight, and it doesn't blink.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then it stands up and walks onto his lawn.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "And one window is still open. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
